---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BookingDemo from '../components/BookingDemo.astro';
import '../styles/booking-demo.css';
import '../styles/home.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={"AJ Car Detailing | Mobile Auto Detailing in Ashburn, Virginia"}
  description={"AJ Car Detailing, mobile expert auto detailing in Ashburn, Virginia. Interior, exterior, full details, paint correction and ceramic coatings at your driveway. Book a free quote at (703) 936-1803."}
  transparentHeader={true}
>
  <h1 class="visually-hidden">Professional Car Detailing in Ashburn, Virginia | AJ Car Detailing</h1>
  <main id="main">
   <section class="hero" aria-label="AJ Car Detailing hero"> <div class="hero__media"> <video class="hero__video is-active" src="/detailing/videos/hero-main.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/hero-main.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" aria-hidden="true"></video> <div class="hero__veil"></div> </div> <div class="hero__inner container"> <img src="/detailing/images/aj-car-detailing-logo.png" alt="AJ Car Detailing, mobile auto detailing in Ashburn, Virginia" class="hero__logo" width="900" height="320"> <div class="hero__meta" aria-label="Areas served"> <span class="hero__meta-item">Ashburn</span> <span class="hero__meta-item">Leesburg</span> <span class="hero__meta-item">Sterling</span> <span class="hero__meta-item">Herndon</span> <span class="hero__meta-item">Reston</span> </div> <p class="hero__lede">
Mobile auto detailing brought to your driveway. Interior, exterior, paint correction and ceramic coatings, finished by hand every time.
</p> <a href="#book" class="btn btn--ghost hero__cta-btn">
Book a Detail <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span> </a> </div> <a href="#services" class="hero__scroll" aria-label="Scroll to services"> <span>Scroll</span> <svg width="14" height="22" viewBox="0 0 14 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v20m0 0L1 15m6 6l6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg> </a> </section>  <div class="strip" aria-hidden="true"> <div class="strip__track"> <div class="strip__group"> <span>Mobile Detailing</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Paint Correction</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Ceramic Coating</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Hand Wash</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Interior Restoration</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Ashburn &middot; Leesburg &middot; Sterling &middot; Herndon &middot; Reston</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> </div><div class="strip__group"> <span>Mobile Detailing</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Paint Correction</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Ceramic Coating</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Hand Wash</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Interior Restoration</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> <span>Ashburn &middot; Leesburg &middot; Sterling &middot; Herndon &middot; Reston</span><i class="strip__dot"></i> </div> </div> </div>  <section id="services" class="section services"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-head" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span> <h2>Five Ways We Make Your Vehicle Look New.</h2> <p class="section-head__lead">From a quick freshen up to a multi day ceramic build. Pick the service that fits, or message us and we will recommend the right one for your vehicle.</p> </div> <div class="services__grid" data-stagger="100"> <a href="/detailing/services" class="service-card" data-reveal> <div class="service-card__media"> <img src="/detailing/images/work/interior-detail.jpg" alt="Interior Detailing" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"> </div> <div class="service-card__body"> <h3 class="service-card__title">Interior Detailing</h3> <p class="service-card__desc">Deep interior cleaning. Shampooed seats and carpets, vacuumed crevices, conditioned leather, spotless dash, glass and trim.</p> <span class="service-card__link">Learn More <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></span> </div> </a><a href="/detailing/services" class="service-card" data-reveal> <div class="service-card__media"> <img src="/detailing/images/work/exterior-detail.jpg" alt="Exterior Detailing" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"> </div> <div class="service-card__body"> <h3 class="service-card__title">Exterior Detailing</h3> <p class="service-card__desc">Two bucket hand wash, decontamination, wheels, tires and trim. A finish that catches every eye in the parking lot.</p> <span class="service-card__link">Learn More <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></span> </div> </a><a href="/detailing/services" class="service-card" data-reveal> <div class="service-card__media"> <img src="/detailing/images/work/full-detail.jpg" alt="Full Detail" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"> </div> <div class="service-card__body"> <h3 class="service-card__title">Full Detail</h3> <p class="service-card__desc">Inside and out. Top to bottom. The complete restoration package for a vehicle that looks and feels brand new.</p> <span class="service-card__link">Learn More <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></span> </div> </a><a href="/detailing/services" class="service-card" data-reveal> <div class="service-card__media"> <img src="/detailing/images/work/paint-correction.jpg" alt="Paint Correction" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"> </div> <div class="service-card__body"> <h3 class="service-card__title">Paint Correction</h3> <p class="service-card__desc">Multi stage machine polishing that removes swirls, scratches and oxidation. Mirror finish, restored depth, true colour.</p> <span class="service-card__link">Learn More <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></span> </div> </a><a href="/detailing/services" class="service-card" data-reveal> <div class="service-card__media"> <img src="/detailing/images/work/ceramic-coating.jpg" alt="Ceramic Coating" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"> </div> <div class="service-card__body"> <h3 class="service-card__title">Ceramic Coating</h3> <p class="service-card__desc">Long lasting ceramic protection. Hydrophobic, glossy and shielded from UV, bird droppings, salt and road grime.</p> <span class="service-card__link">Learn More <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></span> </div> </a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="statement"> <div class="container"> <div class="statement__inner" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">The Standard</span> <h2 class="statement__heading">
We treat every car like our own.
<span class="statement__accent">No shortcuts. No excuses. Showroom finish, every time.</span> </h2> <div class="statement__stats"> <div class="stat" data-reveal> <span class="stat__value" data-counter="500">0</span> <span class="stat__label">Cars Detailed</span> </div><div class="stat" data-reveal> <span class="stat__value" data-counter="100">0</span> <span class="stat__label">Mobile Service</span> </div><div class="stat" data-reveal> <span class="stat__value" data-counter="5">0</span> <span class="stat__label">Star Rated</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section work"> <div class="container container--wide"> <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">Real Work. Real Results.</span> <h2>The Receipts.</h2> <p class="section-head__lead">Every clip is a real Ashburn area vehicle. No staged shots. Just hours of focus turned into a finish you can see from across the parking lot.</p> </div> <div class="work__grid" data-stagger="80"> <figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-01.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-01.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Mercedes Gloss</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-02.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-02.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Palisade Interior</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-03.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-03.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Mobile Exterior</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-04.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-04.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Odyssey Cabin</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-05.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-05.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Range Rover Gloss</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-06.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-06.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Leather Care</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-07.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-07.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Tesla Interior</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure><figure class="work-card" data-reveal> <video class="work-card__video" src="/detailing/videos/work-08.mp4" poster="/detailing/images/work/work-08.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-hover-play></video> <figcaption class="work-card__caption"> <span class="work-card__label">Lexus Interior</span> <span class="work-card__play" aria-hidden="true"> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg> </span> </figcaption> </figure> </div> <div class="work__cta" data-reveal> <a href="/detailing/services" class="btn btn--dark btn--large">See More Work <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section why"> <div class="container"> <div class="why__layout"> <div class="why__head" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">Why AJ's</span> <h2>Built On Detail. Run By A Detailer.</h2> <p>This is a one man, fully mobile shop based in Ashburn. You will not get handed off to a call centre or talk to anyone but the person doing the work on your vehicle. That is the difference.</p> <a href="/detailing/about" class="btn btn--outline-dark">About AJ <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> <div class="why__list" data-stagger="120"> <div class="why-item" data-reveal> <span class="why-item__num">01</span> <div> <h4>We Come To You</h4> <p>Fully mobile across Ashburn, Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon and Reston. Driveway, workplace, home. No appointment hassle.</p> </div> </div><div class="why-item" data-reveal> <span class="why-item__num">02</span> <div> <h4>Showroom Quality Finish</h4> <p>Every car treated like our own. Hand washed, hand polished, hand finished. No shortcuts, no excuses.</p> </div> </div><div class="why-item" data-reveal> <span class="why-item__num">03</span> <div> <h4>Premium Products</h4> <p>Professional grade chemicals, microfibers and ceramic coatings. The same products top studios use, brought to your driveway.</p> </div> </div><div class="why-item" data-reveal> <span class="why-item__num">04</span> <div> <h4>Real Local Owner</h4> <p>AJ runs every job personally. You deal directly with the detailer, never a call centre.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section id="book" class="section book-online"> <div class="container container--wide"> <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Book Online</span> <h2>Pick A Service. Pick A Time. Done.</h2> <p class="section-head__lead">Browse packages, pick the one that fits your vehicle and lock in a time. Takes about a minute.</p> </div> <div class="book-online__frame-wrap" data-reveal> <BookingDemo /> </div> <p class="book-online__fallback" data-reveal>
Ready to book for real? <a href="tel:+17039361803">Call or text (703) 936-1803</a> or <a href="#contact">send a message below</a>.
</p> </div> </section>  <section class="section faq"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-head" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span> <h2>Good Questions, Straight Answers.</h2> </div> <div class="faq__list"> <details class="faq-item" open data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>What areas do you serve?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">We are fully mobile and based in Ashburn. We regularly service Ashburn, Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon and Reston and the surrounding Loudoun County area. If you are nearby, ask and we will let you know.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>Do I need to provide water or power?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">No. We bring everything required to complete the job in your driveway, including water and power if needed. All we need is space for the vehicle and our truck.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>How long does a full detail take?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">A full interior and exterior detail typically takes 4 to 8 hours depending on size and condition. Paint correction and ceramic coatings can be a full or multi day job. We confirm timing when we book.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>What is the difference between paint correction and ceramic coating?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">Paint correction physically removes swirls, scratches and oxidation from the clear coat using machine polishers. Ceramic coating is a protective layer applied after correction that locks in the finish, repels water and protects against UV and contaminants for years.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>How do I get a quote?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">Send us a few photos of your vehicle through the form, by email or by text. We provide an honest quote based on the actual condition of the car. No surprises on the day.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>Do you detail trucks, motorcycles and boats?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">Yes. We detail cars, trucks, SUVs, motorcycles, RVs and boats. Anything with paint, leather, plastic, vinyl or carpet, we can clean and protect.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>Are you fully mobile, or do I bring the vehicle to you?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">We are fully mobile. We come to you across Ashburn, Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon and Reston and the surrounding Loudoun County area. We detail right in your driveway, at your workplace or at home. There is nothing to drop off.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>What are your hours?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">We take bookings Monday to Friday from 8am to 6pm and Saturday from 9am to 3pm. You can send photos any time and we will get back to you, often the same day.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>How do I book a detail?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">You can book online through our booking link, or send a few photos of your vehicle by the form, email or text. We confirm a time and an honest quote, often the same day, and there are no surprises when we arrive.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>Do you offer one time details or ongoing maintenance?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">Both. Many customers book a one time full detail to reset their vehicle, then come back for regular maintenance washes and seasonal details to keep it looking its best.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>Do you detail in the winter?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">Yes, we work year round. Winter is when Virginia road salt and slush do the most damage, so an interior reset and an exterior wash with fresh protection matter most in the colder months. For paint correction and ceramic coating we choose suitable conditions so the work is done properly.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>Which service should I choose?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">If the inside needs work, book an interior detail. If the paint needs a clean and protection, book an exterior detail. If you want the whole vehicle reset, book a full detail. Paint correction removes swirls and scratches, and ceramic coating adds years of protection. If you are not sure, send photos and we will recommend the right one.</p> </details><details class="faq-item" data-reveal> <summary class="faq-item__q"> <span>Can you do paint correction and ceramic coating together?</span> <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </summary> <p class="faq-item__a">Yes. Paint correction and ceramic coating are often done together, because correction restores a flawless finish and the coating locks it in and protects it for years. We can quote both in one booking.</p> </details> </div> </div> </section>  <section id="contact" class="section contact"> <div class="container"> <div class="contact__layout"> <div class="contact__copy" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Or Send A Message</span> <h2>Got A Question First?</h2> <p>Prefer to chat before booking? Send a few photos or details and we will get back to you the same day with a quote and timing.</p> <ul class="contact__list"> <li> <span class="contact__label">Call or Text</span> <a href="tel:+17039361803" class="contact__value">(703) 936-1803</a> </li> <li> <span class="contact__label">Email</span> <a href="mailto:ajcardetailz@gmail.com" class="contact__value">ajcardetailz@gmail.com</a> </li> <li> <span class="contact__label">Areas Served</span> <span class="contact__value contact__value--sm">Ashburn, Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon & Reston</span> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="contact__form-wrap" data-reveal="right"> <div class="contact-form-wrapper"> <form class="contact-form" action="#" method="post" data-demo-form> <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New AJ Car Detailing Website Lead"> <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="name">Name <span class="form-required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label> <input type="text" id="name" name="name" class="form-input" placeholder="Your full name" required aria-required="true" autocomplete="name"> </div> <div class="form-row"> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="email">Email <span class="form-required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label> <input type="email" id="email" name="email" class="form-input" placeholder="you@email.com" required aria-required="true" autocomplete="email"> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="phone">Phone</label> <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" class="form-input" placeholder="(519) 555 1234" autocomplete="tel"> </div> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="vehicle">Vehicle</label> <input type="text" id="vehicle" name="vehicle" class="form-input" placeholder="Year, make and model" autocomplete="off"> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="service">Service</label> <select id="service" name="service" class="form-select"> <option value="" disabled selected>Pick a service</option> <option value="Interior Detailing">Interior Detailing</option> <option value="Exterior Detailing">Exterior Detailing</option> <option value="Full Detail">Full Detail</option> <option value="Paint Correction">Paint Correction</option> <option value="Ceramic Coating">Ceramic Coating</option> <option value="Not sure yet">Not sure yet</option> </select> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="message">Details</label> <textarea id="message" name="message" class="form-input" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about your vehicle and what you would like done"></textarea> </div> <button type="submit" class="contact-form__submit"> <span class="contact-form__submit-text">Send Request</span> <span class="contact-form__submit-sending">Sending</span> </button> <p class="contact-form__small">Or text photos of your vehicle straight to <a href="tel:+17039361803">(703) 936-1803</a> for the fastest quote.</p> </form> <div class="contact-form__success" style="display:none" role="status" aria-live="polite"> <div class="contact-form__message contact-form__message--success"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path> <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline> </svg> <p>Request received. AJ will be in touch shortly to confirm timing and quote.</p> </div> </div> <div class="contact-form__error" style="display:none" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"> <div class="contact-form__message contact-form__message--error"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle> <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"></line> <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"></line> </svg> <p>Something went wrong. Call or text (703) 936-1803 and we will get back to you fast.</p> <button type="button" class="contact-form__retry">Try Again</button> </div> </div> </div>   </div> </div> </div> </section>  
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
